{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8208","id":5247887231,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABOMxnfw","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8208","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8208.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8208.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8208","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8208/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8208/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8208/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/624301d969926121942da0ea0c1b37fff7933d25","number":8208,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"doc: agent-note placement design — zettel vs repo vs ID graph (#6022)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Design record for #6022 (Atlas programme #6018, S7–S10). Queue task 12877.\n\n## What this decides\n\nWhere agent notes live, as one applicable rule:\n\n- **The one-step test (§1):** would the note still be true, and still be looked for, if the repo it is about were deleted tomorrow? Yes → zettel (knowledge about the world). No → the repo (knowledge about the artifact). Neither yet → workspace/memory (knowledge about the current attempt).\n- **Decision table (§2):** 10 note classes → home → lifetime → Atlas ingestion tier (0 = ID-native, 1 = first-class corpus, 2 = repo corpus, 3 = provenance only).\n- **Promotion paths (§4):** scratch → zettel only via the single `note_submission` envelope → Turso submission DB → staging → human promotion; nothing auto-commits.\n- **ID-graph publishing (§5):** qualifying classes (cited across systems + stable identity + nameable writer-set per #5545), PROV-lite relations per #6062 in the #5686 vocabulary; graph object canonical for ID-native notes, repo/zettel copies become projections. Memory content never goes ID-native.\n- **Migration (§6):** move on next touch with pointer stubs; no big-bang; memory and sandbox-environment material (hatch-personal, per #5981/#5983) do not move.\n\n## Follow-ons filed\n\n- #8204 — envelope declares placement class + tier\n- #8205 — one-step test pointer in the note-filing docs\n- #8206 — pointer-stub sweep for promotions\n- #6062 (already open) owns the ID-native format §5 consumes\n\nDesign only; no implementation in this PR.\n\n<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=repo-worker-code lane=code-l task=12877 -->\n","labels":[{"id":13198401620,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAADEq-gVA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/audit:completed-later","name":"audit:completed-later","description":"Gap completed by later merged PR","color":"1d76db","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-10T19:53:25Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:24:07Z","closed_at":"